{
 "_설명": "『みすぼらしい老人は、財閥会長だった』 PHASE 1 본녹음 84줄 (확정 캐스트, Typecast ssfm-v30 jpn). 음성 입력만 가나 변형, 자막은 한자 유지. line### = 시간 순서. 콜드오픈 합류(S10)는 L01 녹음 재사용. TTS 구독 크레딧만 사용. 생성: productions/beggar-chairman-ja/build_tts_spec.py",
 "tc_model": "ssfm-v30",
 "language": "jpn",
 "tests": [
  {
   "id": "line001",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ものごいは裏口から出てってくださいって！何度言わせるんですか！",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.1,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line002",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "うわ、これマジで撮ってアップしよ",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line003",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "このレストランで、彼の正体に気づいた者は、一人もいませんでした。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line004",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "たかみやげんぞう、ななじゅうはっさい。たかみやグループの創業者。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line005",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "医者は彼に、残された時間は一年だと告げました。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line006",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ななじゅうねん前。この場所には、小さなうどん屋がありました。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line007",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "家も親もない、やっつの少年。店のおかみは、黙ってかけうどんを出してくれたのです。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line008",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "代金は、一度も受け取りませんでした。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line009",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会社を譲る前に、彼には確かめたいことがありました。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line010",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "自分の会社は今も、腹を空かせた人に、ご飯を出せる場所なのか。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line011",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ちょっと、お客さん。ここ、入られちゃ困るんですけど",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line012",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "飯を一杯、食べに来たんじゃ。かけうどんは、あるかね？",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line013",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "かけうどん？　うちのコースは、一番安くてもさんまんえんですよ",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line014",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "金なら、ある",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line015",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "昔、この場所にあった店を、知っとるかね？",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line016",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "知りませんよ、そんな昔のこと",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line017",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……はぁ、じゃあ、あっちの隅の席にどうぞ。トイレの横です",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line018",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "支配人さん、あっち臭くて飯が食えないんですけど？",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line019",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "これは大変失礼いたしました、まみや社長。すぐに片付けますので",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 1.08
  },
  {
   "id": "line020",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "うちの親父が、この店に毎月いくら落としてると思ってるの？",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line021",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "重々、承知しております",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line022",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "はるかわさん。あの席に、しょうしゅうスプレー",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line023",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……えっ、でも、お客様の前で……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line024",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "お客さん、水だけ飲んだら帰ってください。他のお客様のご迷惑なんで",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line025",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "同じ頃。ホテルの前に、一台の黒い車が、静かに止まりました。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line026",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……はい。会長のご指示どおり、まだ中には入りません",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line027",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "その男が待っていたのは、ある一人の老人の、合図でした。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line028",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "店の中で、老人は、ただ静かに待っていました。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line029",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "その時、思いもよらない人が、老人に声をかけたのです……。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line030",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おじいさん、温かいお茶です。ゆっくり飲んでくださいね",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line031",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ありがとう。お嬢さんは、ここで働いて長いのかね？",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.5,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line032",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "さんかげつです。学費を、稼いでるんです",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line033",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "学費か……。何を、勉強しとるんじゃ？",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line034",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "栄養学です。いつか、子ども食堂を開きたくて",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.98
  },
  {
   "id": "line035",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "うちの祖父も、昔は苦労したって、よく話してくれました",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line036",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……そうかい。いい、おじいさんじゃな",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.5,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line037",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "なぜ、わしなんかに、親切にしてくれるんじゃ？",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line038",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "お腹が空いてる人に、身なりは関係ありませんから",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line039",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "かけうどんは、メニューにないんですけど……厨房に、聞いてみますね",
   "emotion_preset": "whisper",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line040",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "メニューにない、かけうどん。まかないの一杯を、彼女はこっそり用意しました。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line041",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "同じ店の中で、いわきの態度は、客の身なりひとつで変わりました。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line042",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "じいさん、ここはあんたの来る店じゃないよ。帰りな",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line043",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……そうかね。わしには、懐かしい場所なんじゃが",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line044",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "はるかわさん！　まかないを客に出すなんて、何考えてるんですか！",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.1,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line045",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おじいさんが、かけうどんを食べたいって、おっしゃったので……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line046",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "バイトのくせに、出しゃばらないでください。今日で、辞めてもらいます",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line047",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ははっ、ものごいとバイト、セットでクビかよ",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.08
  },
  {
   "id": "line048",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……学費、まだ足りないのに",
   "emotion_preset": "whisper",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line049",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "支配人、うどん代は私が払います。おじいさんに、食べさせてあげてください",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line050",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "お前も一緒に出ていけ！　ふたりとも、今すぐだ！",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line051",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……そのうどん代は、わしが払おう",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line052",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "そのひとことで、店の空気が、変わりました。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line053",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "誰も知らなかったのです。この老人が、何者なのかを……。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line054",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会長。お車の用意が、できております",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line055",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "か、会長……ですって……？",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line056",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "たかみやグループ創業者、たかみやげんぞう会長でいらっしゃいます。このホテルの、オーナーです",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.1,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line057",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "こ、これは、店の規則でして……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line058",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "規則を作ったのは、わしじゃ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line059",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "開店の日に、わしが決めた規則は、一つだけじゃった。腹を空かせた客を、帰すな",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line060",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "いわき支配人。あなたの評価表には、いつも客単価、優秀とありましたね",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line061",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ななじゅうねん前、ここは小さなうどん屋じゃった。家も親もないやっつの子に、タダでかけうどんを出してくれた店じゃ",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line062",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "その子が、わしじゃよ",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line063",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ホテルを建てる時も、あの店の場所だけは、誰にも譲らなかった",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line064",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "腹を空かせた人を追い返す店に……たかみやの名を、掲げる資格はない",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.1,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line065",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65b34b05b3fb844f3d6b7aab",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会長……存じ上げず、本当に、申し訳ございません……！",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.1,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line066",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "知らなかったから申し訳ない、か……。知っておったら、しなかったということじゃな",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line067",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "明日からは、もう来なくて結構です",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line068",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会長、あの……うちの父が、たかみやさんの取引先をやってまして……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line069",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "まみや社長のお父様には、今夜、会長が直接お電話なさいます",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line070",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "けしても、今夜のことは、皆が覚えていますよ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line071",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "お嬢さん、うどんを……もう一杯、温めてくれるかね？",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "line072",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "はい！　すぐ、温めてきます！",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line073",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ななじゅうねんぶりじゃ……。同じ味が、する",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line074",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63be4f467ac1708d9ccd75d4",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "私、本当に、何も知らなくて……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line075",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "知らなかったから、よかったんじゃよ",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line076",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "お嬢さんはらいねんどから、たかみやのしょうがくせいじゃ。学費の心配は、いらんよ",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line077",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a5882fe54564e2a06a218bb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "さかき、今日からこの店のメニューに、かけうどんを載せなさい。腹を空かせた人からは、おだいはもらわんように",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line078",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "その日から、たかみやていのメニューの最後には、こう書かれています。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line079",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "はるかわちひろさんは今、栄養士を目指して、勉強を続けています。",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line080",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "そして週末には、たかみやていで、一杯のかけうどんを運んでいます。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line081",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "その夜、たかみや会長は、ゆいごんしょにいちぎょうを書き加えました。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line082",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "どん底でひざまずいたことのある者だけが、人をひざまずかせない。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line083",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "そして一年後。このいちぎょうが、彼の孫を、配達員にするのです。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "line084",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "皆様のまわりにも、一杯のうどんを差し出せる人はいますか？　コメントで教えてください",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.92
  }
 ]
}